  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EMPOWERING YOUTHS THROUGH A HOLISTIC APPROACH TO CHILD RIGHTS IN BUNJU WARD-KIN</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering Youth Through Football: A Holistic Approach to Child Rights in Bunju Ward &#x2013; Kinondoni - Municipality in Tanzania: The project seeks to use a comprehensive approach to reach children, parents, and community members, focusing on protecting children from abuse and neglect. This will be through football matches, educational sessions and awareness raising sessions to both children, teachers and parents. Furthermore, this project will create safe spaces where children can discuss issues affecting them, facilitated by trained counsellors.</narrative>
  </description>
